  m_text: 'This is your <color=#2ee4f2>Tackle Box</color>, here you can change which
    fishing rods and bait you have equipped.


    <color=#2ee4f2>Fishing rods</color>
    increase the chances of catching rarer fish!


    <color=#2ee4f2>Bait</color>
    decreases the success threshold for fishing! '
